---
// Schema architettura SORAVENT, rimosso dalla homepage col passaggio alle
// card compatte. Parcheggiato qui, al momento senza usi: servirà per la
// futura pagina dedicata /progetti/soravent.
import type { HomeLang } from '../i18n/home';

interface Props { lang?: HomeLang }
const { lang = 'it' } = Astro.props;
---
{lang === 'it' ? (
  <div class="schematic">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 680 73" role="img" aria-label="Architettura di SORAVENT" class="reveal">
      <path class="wire" d="M150 45 H 190"/>
      <path class="wire" d="M330 45 H 370"/>
      <path class="wire hot" d="M510 45 H 550"/>
      <g class="node"><rect x="30" y="22" width="120" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="90" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Auth</text><text x="90" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">accesso a slot numerati</text></g>
      <g class="node hot"><rect x="190" y="22" width="140" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="260" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Moduli contenuto</text><text x="260" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">research + mind</text></g>
      <g class="node"><rect x="370" y="22" width="140" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="440" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Diario</text><text x="440" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">stato + progressi</text></g>
      <g class="node hot"><rect x="550" y="22" width="100" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="600" y="42" text-anchor="middle">PDF engine</text><text x="600" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">export</text></g>
    </svg>
  </div>
) : (
  <div class="schematic">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 680 73" role="img" aria-label="SORAVENT architecture" class="reveal">
      <path class="wire" d="M150 45 H 190"/>
      <path class="wire" d="M330 45 H 370"/>
      <path class="wire hot" d="M510 45 H 550"/>
      <g class="node"><rect x="30" y="22" width="120" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="90" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Auth</text><text x="90" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">numbered-slot access</text></g>
      <g class="node hot"><rect x="190" y="22" width="140" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="260" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Content modules</text><text x="260" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">research + mind</text></g>
      <g class="node"><rect x="370" y="22" width="140" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="440" y="42" text-anchor="middle">Journal</text><text x="440" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">state + progress</text></g>
      <g class="node hot"><rect x="550" y="22" width="100" height="46" rx="4"/><text x="600" y="42" text-anchor="middle">PDF engine</text><text x="600" y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="tag">export</text></g>
    </svg>
  </div>
)}
